sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as LIS
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant E as EHR
  participant P as Pager
  participant I as Infection control
  L->>G: ORU RES-1202 (K 6.9 HH)
  G->>E: RES-1202 (MLLP)
  E-->>G: ACK AA
  G->>G: filters: pager (the K order is critical)
  G-->>L: the EHR's ACK AA
  G->>P: POST RES-1202
  P-->>G: 200
  L->>G: ORU RES-1204 (BCX negative, urinalysis A)
  G->>E: RES-1204
  E-->>G: ACK AA
  G->>G: filters: none (no culture order is abnormal)
  G-->>L: ACK AA
  L->>G: ORU RES-1205 (unknown patient, HH)
  G->>E: RES-1205
  E-->>G: ACK AR patient not found
  G-->>L: ACK AR (not copied)
  Note over E: EHR down
  L->>G: ORU RES-1206 (GLU 38 LL)
  G-xE: connection refused
  G-->>L: ACK AE (not copied)
  Note over E: EHR back
  L->>G: RES-1206 again
  G->>E: RES-1206
  E-->>G: ACK AA
  G-->>L: ACK AA
  G->>P: POST RES-1206
  Note over P: Pager down
  L->>G: ORU RES-1207 (K LL, urine culture A)
  G->>E: RES-1207
  E-->>G: ACK AA
  G-->>L: ACK AA
  G->>I: POST RES-1207
  G-xP: POST RES-1207: 503, retried
  Note over P: Pager back
  G->>P: POST RES-1207
  P-->>G: 200
